-- ============================================================================
-- P1-cases-seat-controller.l4 -- cases for the seat of a controller.  Expected values are written from the text (the layer-1 tests
-- in P1-tests-art-N.l4 hold the full set of branches); each case here is a person's facts and the answer the Regulation gives.
-- Cases marked -- MIRROR are asked from the other seat with the same facts, and the answers agree (P1-cases-mirror.l4 asserts it).
-- ============================================================================


§ `Article 2 -- does the Regulation reach the processing?`

-- MIRROR 2
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(1) and (2), as a controller, is my processing of personal data within the material scope of this Regulation` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Art 2(2)(d) another purpose` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(1) and (2), as a controller, is my processing of personal data within the material scope of this Regulation` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE `Art 2(2)(d) another purpose` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(1) and (2), as a controller, is my processing of personal data within the material scope of this Regulation` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE `Art 2(2)(d) detection of criminal offences` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(1) and (2), as a controller, is my processing of personal data within the material scope of this Regulation` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `Art 2(2)(d) another purpose` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 4 -- who and what the definitions pick out`

#ASSERT `Under Article 4(1), as a controller, is the information I hold personal data` TRUE TRUE FALSE `Art 4(1) a name` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 4(1), as a controller, is the information I hold personal data` TRUE FALSE TRUE `Art 4(1) an online identifier` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 4(1), as a controller, is the information I hold personal data` TRUE FALSE FALSE `Art 4(1) a name` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 4(1), as a controller, is the information I hold personal data` FALSE TRUE TRUE `Art 4(1) a name` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 4(2), as a controller, is what I do with personal data processing` `Art 4(2) storage` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 4(2), as a controller, is what I do with personal data processing` `Art 4(2) erasure` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 4(2), as a controller, is what I do with personal data processing` `Art 4(2) storage` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 4(6), as a controller, is my set of personal data a filing system` TRUE TRUE TRUE `Art 4(6) centralised` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 4(6), as a controller, is my set of personal data a filing system` FALSE TRUE TRUE `Art 4(6) centralised` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 4(6), as a controller, is my set of personal data a filing system` TRUE TRUE FALSE `Art 4(6) dispersed on a geographical basis` EQUALS JUST FALSE
