§ `Article 5 -- the principles the processing must meet`

#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(a), as a controller, are the personal data I process processed lawfully, fairly and in a transparent manner` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(a), as a controller, are the personal data I process processed lawfully, fairly and in a transparent manner` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(b), as a controller, are the personal data collected for specified, explicit and legitimate purposes and not further processed incompatibly` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE `Art 5(1)(b) some other purpose` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(b), as a controller, are the personal data collected for specified, explicit and legitimate purposes and not further processed incompatibly` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `Art 5(1)(b) scientific research purposes` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(b), as a controller, are the personal data collected for specified, explicit and legitimate purposes and not further processed incompatibly` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `Art 5(1)(b) scientific research purposes` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(b), as a controller, are the personal data collected for specified, explicit and legitimate purposes and not further processed incompatibly` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE `Art 5(1)(b) some other purpose` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(c), as a controller, are the personal data I process adequate, relevant and limited to what is necessary` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(c), as a controller, are the personal data I process adequate, relevant and limited to what is necessary` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(d), as a controller, are the personal data I process accurate and, where necessary, kept up to date` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(d), as a controller, are the personal data I process accurate and, where necessary, kept up to date` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(d), as a controller, have I taken every reasonable step to erase or rectify inaccurate personal data without delay` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is met`
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(d), as a controller, have I taken every reasonable step to erase or rectify inaccurate personal data without delay` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is not met`
-- no inaccurate data: Art 5(1)(d) second limb is a scope limit with no gate word, so NOTHING (periods ruling (c); fork F5-2)
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(d), as a controller, have I taken every reasonable step to erase or rectify inaccurate personal data without delay` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(e), as a controller, do I keep the personal data in a form which permits identification no longer than is necessary` TRUE FALSE `Art 5(1)(b) some other purpose` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(e), as a controller, do I keep the personal data in a form which permits identification no longer than is necessary` TRUE TRUE `Art 5(1)(b) statistical purposes` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(e), as a controller, do I keep the personal data in a form which permits identification no longer than is necessary` TRUE TRUE `Art 5(1)(b) some other purpose` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- identifiable, kept longer, statistical purposes but Article 89(1) is not met: the second limb answers NOTHING (grant ruling, limit 1; fork F5-3) and the first limb stands, so JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(e), as a controller, do I keep the personal data in a form which permits identification no longer than is necessary` TRUE TRUE `Art 5(1)(b) statistical purposes` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(f), as a controller, are the personal data processed in a manner that ensures appropriate security` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(1)(f), as a controller, are the personal data processed in a manner that ensures appropriate security` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(2), as a controller, am I responsible for compliance with Article 5(1)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(2), as a controller, am I responsible for compliance with Article 5(1)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- MIRROR 5_2
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(2), as a controller, am I able to demonstrate compliance with Article 5(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 5(2), as a controller, am I able to demonstrate compliance with Article 5(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

