#ASSERT `Under Article 6(1), as a controller, is the condition met that at least one of points (a) to (f) applies to my processing` `P1 controller answer: no` `P1 controller answer: no` `P1 controller answer: no` `P1 controller answer: no` `P1 controller answer: no` `P1 controller answer: no` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 6(1), as a controller, is the condition met that at least one of points (a) to (f) applies to my processing` `P1 controller answer: no` `P1 controller answer: no` `P1 controller answer: no` `P1 controller answer: no` `P1 controller answer: no` `P1 controller answer: not sure` EQUALS NOTHING
