#ASSERT `Under Article 6(2), as a controller, may a Member State maintain or introduce more specific provisions for my processing` `Art 6(1)(e) public interest or official authority` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 6(2), as a controller, may a Member State maintain or introduce more specific provisions for my processing` `Art 6(1)(a) consent` EQUALS NOTHING
