§ `Article 7 -- consent`

-- MIRROR 7_1
#ASSERT `Under Article 7(1), as a controller, am I able to demonstrate that the data subject has consented` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is met`
#ASSERT `Under Article 7(1), as a controller, am I able to demonstrate that the data subject has consented` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is not met`
#ASSERT `Under Article 7(1), as a controller, am I able to demonstrate that the data subject has consented` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `the duty does not arise`
#ASSERT `Under Article 7(2), as a controller, is the request for consent presented clearly where consent is given in a written declaration that also concerns other matters` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is met`
#ASSERT `Under Article 7(2), as a controller, is the request for consent presented clearly where consent is given in a written declaration that also concerns other matters` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is not met`
#ASSERT `Under Article 7(2), as a controller, is the request for consent presented clearly where consent is given in a written declaration that also concerns other matters` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `the duty does not arise`
