§ `Article 8 -- a child's consent to information society services`

-- MIRROR 8_1
#ASSERT `Under Article 8(1), as a controller, does the processing of the child's personal data meet the condition of Article 8(1)` TRUE TRUE 15 FALSE 0 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 8(1), as a controller, does the processing of the child's personal data meet the condition of Article 8(1)` TRUE TRUE 15 FALSE 0 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 8(1), as a controller, does the processing of the child's personal data meet the condition of Article 8(1)` TRUE TRUE 16 FALSE 0 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 8(1), as a controller, does the processing of the child's personal data meet the condition of Article 8(1)` TRUE TRUE 12 TRUE 13 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 8(1), as a controller, does the processing of the child's personal data meet the condition of Article 8(1)` TRUE TRUE 13 TRUE 13 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 6(1)(a) does not apply: "Where point (a) of Article 6(1) applies" fails, JUST FALSE (periods ruling (b); fork F8-5)
