#ASSERT `Under Article 24(2), as a controller, do my measures include the implementation of appropriate data protection policies where proportionate` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `the duty arises and is not met`
#ASSERT `Under Article 24(2), as a controller, do my measures include the implementation of appropriate data protection policies where proportionate` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `the duty does not arise`
