#ASSERT `Under Article 24(3), as a controller, may my adherence to an approved code of conduct or certification mechanism be used as an element to demonstrate compliance` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 24(3), as a controller, may my adherence to an approved code of conduct or certification mechanism be used as an element to demonstrate compliance` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
